      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im a parent of a 7yo and im kinda struggling with how to handle stuff they hear at school about gender identity and pronouns. like, how can i explain these concepts to my kid in a way that is age-appropriate and actually correct? i want to make sure i'm doing it the right way.",
