    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. but i guess i'm a bit worried about \"correctness\" like i mentioned. some parents think it's better to wait until kids are older so they don't get confused by stuff like non-binary identities or changing pronouns. is it actually better for their development to dive into this stuff now, or is that just one way of looking at it?",
